# IMPLEMENTATION_STEPS: cu-002

1. Add the binary parameter and stdin redirect in pipelines/enrichment/src/main/scala/newspipe/infrastructure/llm-data-enricher/OpenCodeCliClient.scala. Replace this line:

```scala
final class OpenCodeCliClient(model: String, timeout: FiniteDuration) extends EnrichmentPort:
```

with:

```scala
final class OpenCodeCliClient(model: String, timeout: FiniteDuration, binary: String = "opencode") extends EnrichmentPort:
```

Then replace this process construction:

```scala
      val proc = new ProcessBuilder("opencode", "run", "--format", "json", "--model", model, prompt)
        .redirectErrorStream(false)
        .start()
```

with:

```scala
      val proc = new ProcessBuilder(binary, "run", "--format", "json", "--model", model, prompt)
        .redirectErrorStream(false)
        .redirectInput(ProcessBuilder.Redirect.from(new java.io.File("/dev/null")))
        .start()
```

Do NOT touch: prompts/enrich.txt, pipelines/ingestion/**, conf/enrichment.conf

Prove: `grep -c 'redirectInput' pipelines/enrichment/src/main/scala/newspipe/infrastructure/llm-data-enricher/OpenCodeCliClient.scala`

Stop when the proof prints 1.

